# QA (M2, fixed in E13 by D-051): a Gondel rider used to be pushed off by
# the camera's left edge (the carry was clamped to it while the camera never
# scrolls back) and fell to her death. Now a platform's carry may take her
# left past the screen edge and the camera follows her left by the same
# amount.
# Steps: st_gilgen_gondeln (A -> B -> C, off C onto the ledge/street at
# x 1412, frame 1126), walk on to x 1438 (camera x 1301, a few steps past
# the ledge), walk back onto the ledge 83-85 and hop onto Gondel C waiting
# at its lower end (x 1296, landing ~1330), then stand still on its roof.
# C travels up-left to the pylon (x 1184); from frame ~1368 Resi's hitbox
# is carried past the old camera edge (x 1301) and the camera follows her
# left.
# Before the fix: held at camera.x, she dropped off the cabin's left end
# and died in the ravine (DeathCause::Pit; the original bug run: death at
# 1424).
# Now: she rides on (x ~1205 at the end, camera x = her x), no death.
# Filmstrip: cargo xtask filmstrip qa_m2_gondel_camera_edge_push --every 10
level  = st_gilgen
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = deaths=0 no_event=Died state=playing
---
# st_gilgen_gondeln (frames 0-1126)
RB 100
RBJ 12
RB 15
RBJ 36
RB 6
RBJ 20
RB 32
RBJ 34
RB 25
L 4         # brake at the platform edge (x 737; Gondel C activates)
- 70        # wait for Gondel A to come back
RJ 8        # hop onto its roof (~frame 356)
R 6
- 125       # ride A up to the knoll
R 60
- 197       # wait on the knoll for Gondel B
R 40        # walk off the edge onto B (~790)
- 110       # ride B across the ravine
R 24        # onto the pylon (918)
RJ 4        # tap jump onto Gondel C, just leaving the pylon (~950)
R 8
- 100       # ride C down to its lower end
R 70        # walk off onto the ledge and the street
- 20
R 14        # a few steps further right: camera x 1301
- 10
L 30
LJ 10       # back up onto the ledge 83-85
L 14
- 90        # Gondel C arrives at its lower end (x 1296)
LJ 8        # hop onto its roof (lands ~1330)
L 10
- 150       # stand still and ride up towards the pylon
